{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113421","id":3061574359,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62e-rX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113421.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113421/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113421/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113421/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/baef28853d2726c281dfe4226fe31e8f3addec02","number":113421,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Hicon null error: Add permanent buffer and cache for DisplayServerWindows method","user":{"login":"archiethehead","id":182214766,"node_id":"U_kgDOCtxgbg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182214766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead","html_url":"https://github.com/archiethehead","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archiethehead/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #113350\r\n\r\nRectified an error seen with an intel graphics driver where persistent tab switching would result in an unusable editor and an error log pointing to display_server_windows.cpp. I believe the error comes down to local memory within the set_icon method being freed before Windows is done using it, in combination with multiple threads racing for the creation and destruction of the HICON variable. I am proposing these precautions as a potential fix:\r\n\r\n1. **Permanent Buffer and Cache:** Adding a cache and buffer variable to the class defaults that the method can draw from (set to null when an invalid image has been entered).\r\n2. **Lock Guard:** A mutex variable used to limit the use of the method to one thread at a time as an extra precaution against interference with in-use data.\r\n3. **Difference Check:** A conditional checks if the icon has actually changed before creating a new resource, opting to use the data in the buffer instead, decreasing chances of variable mutation during use.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","de